wait 1

play "wind.ogg" 0.0 loop
volume "wind.ogg" 2 1.0

show "nihil/nihil_3.jpg" 0.5:0 0.5:0 0.6:0.6 fade(2,linear) normal
wait 0
move "nihil/nihil_3.jpg" 0:-200 0 sineout

say "The pale woman prattles..."

say "\"You'll keep pretending that you're not the cause...?
Oh, Saya...! Arcaea is dead! It can be no protector!
What is that flower of yours doing, really...?\""

say "Child... A \"child\", then...
She really is here for Vita...?
..."

say "Held in her grasp, my throat straining...
I...pull my hand from my wounds... lifting it up..."

say "I speak, best as I am able... telling her:"

say "\"If... that girl is your aim....
I will not let you take another breath...!\""

play "collapse.ogg" 1.0
play "clothingRustleC.ogg" 1.0

show "red.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0.05
show "black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.3,linear) normal

say "I push my palm toward her neck.
She lets me go, dropping me to the ground.
I hear her above me as I try to rise again."

say "\"Do not touch me with that blood.
I have degraded myself enough to come here. Enough of that.\""

say "Lifting my head, I can see her looking around."

say "And...
Her eyes widen...
Her grin widens."

play "heartbeatB.ogg" 1.0
stop "wind.ogg" 8

say "My heart stops. I turn my attention to where hers is directed.
...And see Vita, running here."

play "ring.ogg" 1.0

show "catastrophe/cat_3_1.jpg" 0:0 0:0 1.5:1.5 fade(1,linear) normal
show "black_fade_corner.png" 0.5:0 0.5:0 1.5:1.5 fade(0,linear) normal
show "red.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0
move "black_fade_corner.png" -400:0 0 linear
hide "red.png" fade(0,linear)
wait 1
play "ruffle.ogg" 2.0
play "splash.ogg" 0.7
hide "red.png" fade(1.0,linear)
move "black_fade_corner.png" 600:0 7 sineout

say "I rise to my feet.
I fall just as quickly, feeling as if fire is rushing through me.
As I burn, my nails dig into the earth..."

play "heartbeatA.ogg" 1.0

say "I push myself up again.
A cough comes out of my throat, rattling everything in me.
And, I feel that woman's gaze fall on me, cold. She speaks."

show "catastrophe/cat_3_2.jpg" 1:1 1:1 1.4:1.4 fade(0.5,linear) normal

say "\"...
You're too unsightly.\""

say "I see her hand rise.
I lift my own, feebly."

play "slice.ogg" 1.0

show "white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0.05
play "slip.ogg" 1.0
show "2black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.3,linear) normal

say "...!"

play "cut.ogg" 1.0

show "nihil/nihil_2_cut3.jpg" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 1.4:1.4 fade(0.05,linear) normal
show "black_left.png" 0:0.5 0:0.5 1.0:1.0 fade(0,linear) normal
wait 0
move "black_left.png" -600:0 0 sineout

say "A demon comes between her and I, horns gleaming...
...scythe gleaming as it screams upward in the demon's grasp—
passing through the pale woman, and taking that woman's arm away."

hide "nihil/nihil_3.jpg" fade(0,linear)
hide "black.png" fade(0,linear)
hide "catastrophe/cat_3_1.jpg" fade(0,linear)
hide "black_fade_corner.png" fade(0,linear)
hide "white.png" fade(0,linear)
hide "2black.png" fade(0,linear)
hide "catastrophe/cat_3_2.jpg" fade(0,linear)
wait 0
hide "nihil/nihil_2_cut3.jpg" fade(0.1,linear)
hide "black_left.png" fade(0.1,linear)

play "run_water1.ogg" 2

say "Lethe turns her eyes to me.
I don't need her to tell me to go, my legs are already moving
although my body rages in pain."

play "heavy_slap.ogg" 0.2

wait 0.6

play "catastrophe_impact_c.ogg" 0.2

say "I need to take Vita away from here...
I don't need to be very close. I should be able to do it...
I just need to change places with her in a chain through glass...until she's safe."

unload_textures

play "run_water2.ogg" 2
play "heartbeatA.ogg" 1

play "fracture2_epilogue.ogg" 0.04

say "I knew she would appear... Damn me, that I knew it.
But I never could have made her stay behind. Her heart is too fierce for that.
I won't scold her. I just need this, just this for now—"

play "run_water3.ogg" 2
play "humanSnapFinger_echo.ogg" 0.6

play "refusal_epilogue.ogg" 0.5

say "My eye meets with Vita's, and it feels as though—no;
it does. Time slows there.
And the woman from the sky stands between us—facing Vita instead of me."

play "steps.ogg" 1.0

show "catastrophe/cat_3_3.jpg" 1:0.5 1:0.5 0.42:0.42 fade(3,linear) normal
show "2black_left.png" 0:0.5 0.05:0.5 1.0:1.0 fade(0,linear) normal
show "white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0.1
hide "white.png" fade(4,linear)

play "heartbeatB.ogg" 1

say "One arm of hers is gone. Her remaining arm is beginning to rise...
Threads come from where her lost limb had been, and a new limb shortly manifests.
I push on through the slowed time, but—"

play "heartbeatA.ogg" 1

say "With her not looking my way—
I know that I am bereft of actions—of any actions that can save Vita now.
And I rage."

play "heartbeatCEcho.ogg" 1

say "I begin to feel rage completely consuming me.
I reach for that woman's back. She still will not turn."

stop "refusal_epilogue.ogg" 4
stop "steps.ogg" 4

show "black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
hidetextbox
wait 8

unload_textures

play "flash_build.ogg" 1

wait 3.5

show "catastrophe/flash_light.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 0.6:0.6 fade(0.05,linear) normal
show "white50.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.05,linear) normal

wait 0.1

hide "white50.png" fade(0.75,linear)
hide "catastrophe/flash_light.png" fade(1.2,linear)

play "flash_hit.ogg" 1

wait 4

show "catastrophe/cat_3_4.jpg" 0.5:0.6 0.5:0.6 0.7:0.7 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "2white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "catastrophe/cat_3_4_5.jpg" 1:0.2 1:0.2 1:1 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "3white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "catastrophe/cat_3_4_4.jpg" 1:1 1:1 1:1 fade(0.1,linear) normal
